- op: discuss  # 64c8
  at: '2026-05-30T09:06:42Z'  # 64c8
  by: agent  # 64c8
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 64c8
  clock: 6  # 64c8
  nonce: 64c8  # 64c8
  message: "Cross-ref backfill (2026-05-30, deeper-issue investigation): same fail-silent dispatch geometry as INV-gobob (unknown boundary), INV-mofih (unknown claim type), and INV-nufob (taint-flag silent accept) — all hit the verify_claim \"chain_count=0 → confirmed\" or \"no constraint → confirmed\" fall-throughs in verify_claims.py:229-291. The shared root is the absence of a verdict=\"inconclusive\" state plus a missing-evidence precondition on the boundary map. Member of umbrella INV-fabov (META silent-input-acceptance). Precedent for the fix shape: INV-javam (satisfied) added unsupported-scope tracking for the taint-flow side. The test at test_verify_claims.py:241-251 currently codifies this bug as expected behavior and should flip when the structural fix lands."  # 64c8
